  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After the light finishes, the fungi radiate strongly instead of wilting. He checks them with investigative methods and is satisfied enough to plan wide scale plantation. His wood path attainment is lower than Fairy Tong Hua’s. The light of wisdom, Shadow Sect and Lang Ya Sect inheritances, and access to many Immortal Gu let him create the move. Perseverance Immortal Gu, self love Immortal Gu, and wood sprout Immortal Gu are the cores, with snack Immortal Gu supplementing, so green light shine fungi become pure white fungi suited to the sky. Wood sprout Immortal Gu is borrowed from Lang Ya Sect. Perseverance and self love are already his. He had just refined snack Immortal Gu. He places the modified fungi in Mini Orange Heaven and Mini White Heaven, where aurora lights and multicolored overlord flowers need intense light.",
      "chapters": [
        1458
      ],
